Package: razorclamrecruitment
Title: Pacific Razor Clam Recruitment and Ocean Conditions on the Washington Coast, 1997-2024
Version: 0.3.0
Description: Reproducible re-analysis pipeline (01_code/R/, run with ./run_pipeline.sh) for
    the relationship between Washington coast razor clam year-class strength and ocean
    conditions, with a manuscript in preparation. This file lists the R packages the
    pipeline needs (Imports) and those the legacy notebook and the data-acquisition
    scripts need (Suggests); renv.lock records the exact versions the committed outputs
    were produced with.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    here,
    tidyverse,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    purrr,
    readr,
    stringr,
    ggplot2,
    tibble,
    readxl,
    lubridate,
    nlme,
    lme4,
    maps,
    mapdata
Suggests:
    openxlsx,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    scales,
    corrplot,
    patchwork,
    sf,
    jsonlite,
    rerddap,
    dataRetrieval,
    ncdf4,
    httr2,
    renv
